From: 89d0f12ace98335441be979ceb35277284b18221
Subject: [PATCH] FROMLIST: [net-next,v2,1/2] bpf: Allow CGROUP_SKB eBPF program to access sk_buff

上游 backport, 来自 mt6873-dev/android_kernel_xiaomi_mt6885@cgroup-v2
原提交日期: 2017-06-03T00:04:59Z

原提交: https://github.com/mt6873-dev/android_kernel_xiaomi_mt6885/commit/89d0f12ace98335441be979ceb35277284b18221

---
diff --git a/kernel/bpf/verifier.c b/kernel/bpf/verifier.c
--- a/kernel/bpf/verifier.c
+++ b/kernel/bpf/verifier.c
@@ -3552,6 +3552,7 @@ static bool may_access_skb(enum bpf_prog_type type)
 	case BPF_PROG_TYPE_SOCKET_FILTER:
 	case BPF_PROG_TYPE_SCHED_CLS:
 	case BPF_PROG_TYPE_SCHED_ACT:
+	case BPF_PROG_TYPE_CGROUP_SKB:
 		return true;
 	default:
 		return false;